repository-code: 'https://github.com/Griminir5/multisolid-CL'
url: 'https://github.com/Griminir5/multisolid-CL'
abstract: >-
  MultiSolid-CL is a tool for simulating reactive packed
  beds, with a focus on chemical looping processes. It
  couples gas flow, heat transfer, and gas-gas as well as
  gas-solid reactions. The tool provides a desktop
  application and command-line interface for individual
  simulations, parameter studies, and comparison of results.
  Available species, properties, and reaction kinetics are
  customizable and extendable via the plugin interface.
keywords:
  - packed bed
  - chemical looping
  - reactor simulation
